    {
      "id": 7665311580214,
      "title": "BRAND NEW SAMSUNG MICROWAVE (ME19CB704112/AA) - BESPOKE Smart 1.9 cu. ft. Over-the-Range Microwave with Sensor Cook - White Glass",
      "handle": "microwave-me19cb704112-aa-samsung-bespoke-smart-1-9-cu-ft-over-the-range-microwave-with-sensor-cook-white-glass",
      "body_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/9449/1190/files/BRAND_NEW_LOGO_240x240.png?v=1725737689\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">This Over-the-Range microwave includes smart technology that makes microwave cooking even easier. Powerful ventilation used while cooking keeps your kitchen virtually odorless. Bespoke kitchen appliances are available in complementary colors to the Bespoke refrigerator.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<h1 class=\"font-bold no-margin\">Features</h1>\n<ul class=\"p-l-15 small\">\n<li>Bespoke Smart Over-the-Range Microwave in White Glass with a sizeable 1.9 cu. ft. capacity.</li>\n<li>This smart microwave is Wi-Fi and voice enabled, featuring Sensor Cook technology that will automatically adjust cooking times for optimal results.</li>\n<li>Beautifully complements other Bespoke White Glass kitchen appliances.</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Convenience</strong></p>\n<p><br>• Eco Mode (Reduces Standby Power)<br>• Clock (12 hr/24 hr) with<br>Daylight Saving Time Adjustment<br>• Kitchen Timer<br>• End Signal<br>• Interior Light: Incandescent (1)<br>• Cooktop Lighting (Halogen): High/Low/Off<br>• Vent Fan Control: Boost/Hi/Mid/Lo/Off<br>• Child Safety Lock<br>• Sound On/Off</p>\n<h3><br></h3>\n<h3><strong>Specifications</strong></h3>\n<p><br>• Oven Cavity: 1.9 cu. ft.<br>• Power Output: 1000W<br>• Power Consumption: 1700W/14.5 A<br>• Power Source: 120V/60 Hz<br>• Control Method: Glass Touch<br>• Display: White LED<br>• Cooking Control: 10 Power Levels Including<br>Defrost and Sensor Cook<br>• Cooking Timer: Digital, up to 99 Minutes, 99 Seconds<br>• Microwave Distribution System: Turntable<br>• Glass Turntable Diameter: 14 3⁄16\"<br>• Vent Fan: 4-Speed/400 CFM<br>• Vent Fan Control: Boost/Hi/Mid/Lo/Off<br>• Cooktop Lighting: High/Low/Off<br>• Incandescent Interior Light</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Product Dimensions &amp; Weight (WxHxD)</strong><br>Cavity Dimensions: 22 1/8\" x 10 13/16\" x 14 27/32\"<br>Outside Net Dimensions: 29 7/8\" x 17 1/16\" x 16 1/2\"<br><strong>Weight:</strong> 60.0 lbs</p>\n<p><br><strong>Shipping Dimensions &amp; Weight (WxHxD)</strong><br>Dimensions: 33 11/32\" x 20 25/32\" x 19 3/8\"<br><strong>Weight:</strong> 67.2 lbs</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>",
