      "handle": "microwave-me21dg6300sraa-2-1-cu-ft-over-the-range-microwave-with-wi-fi-in-fingerprint-resistant-stainless-steel",
      "body_html": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/9449/1190/files/ORIGINAL.png?v=1725737689\" width=\"167\" height=\"167\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"> Features</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br> • Auto Connectivity<br> • LED Display<br> • SmartThings Cooking<br> • Glass Touch Controls<br> • Home Dessert<br> • Ceramic Enamel Interior</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> Wi-Fi Connectivity</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"> </p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"> Convenience</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">• Voice-Enabled<br> •  Clock (12 hr/24 hr) with <br>Daylight Savings Time Adjustment<br> • Reminder End Signal<br> • LED Cooktop Lighting<br> • Halogen Interior Lighting<br> • Vent Fan Control: On/Off/Delay Off<br> • Sound On/Off<br> • Eco Mode</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Functions</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br> • Kitchen Timer<br> • +30 Seconds<br> • Sensor Cook<br> • Auto Cook<br> • Keep Warm<br> • Defrost</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Specifications </h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>• Capacity: 2.1 cu.ft.<br> • 400 CFM Ventilation<br> • Power Output: 1000W<br> • Power Consumption: 1700W</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Product Dimensions (WxHxD)</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br> Dimensions: 297/8\" x 171/16\" x 161/2\" <br>Weight: 58.0 lbs</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br> Shipping Dimensions &amp; Weight (WxHxD)</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br> Dimensions: 3311/32\" x 2013/16\" x 193/8\" <br>Weight: 64.6 lbs</p>",
