    {
      "id": 7665319084086,
      "title": "BRAND NEW SAMSUNG MICROWAVE (ME21DG6700SRAA) Over-The-Range 2.1 Cu. Ft. Bespoke In Fingerprint Resistant Stainless Steel",
      "handle": "microwave-me21dg6700sraa-samsung-over-the-range-2-1-cu-ft-bespoke-in-fingerprint-resistant-stainless-steel",
      "body_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/9449/1190/files/BRAND_NEW_LOGO_240x240.png?v=1725737689\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<h1 class=\"product_section_title\">Features</h1>\n<p><strong>Auto Connectivity</strong><br>Auto Connectivity conveniently syncs your microwave and compatible range or cooktop by using the SmartThings App.* The hood fan and LED lighting will automatically turn on and off when you turn your cooktop on or off, saving you time and extra effort.*</p>\n<p><strong>Wi-Fi Connectivity</strong><br>Connect your microwave to Wi-Fi and the SmartThings app to remotely adjust ventilation speed, lighting, and cook time right from your smartphone, and receive alerts when heating or cooking is finished.*</p>\n<p><strong>Auto-Dimming Glass Touch Controls</strong><br>Auto-dimming glass touch controls illuminate with a simple touch when opening the door, and then dim when not in use for a clean and seamless look.</p>\n<p><strong>Bespoke Design</strong><br>Give your kitchen a modern boost with this stylish and contemporary Bespoke design. Enhance the look of your kitchen with an elegant accent color and edge to edge glass controls that seamlessly blend into your kitchen.</p>\n<p><strong>2.1 Cu. Ft. Oven Capacity</strong><br>The 2.1 cu. ft. capacity has plenty of room to hold larger serving sizes and prepare a variety of foods quickly and easily.</p>\n<p><strong>Sensor Cook</strong><br>Sensor Cook takes the guesswork out of your cooking by automatically adjusting cooking time for optimal results.</p>\n<p><strong>400 CFM Ventilation</strong><br>Extra power ventilation refreshes air quickly to remove steam and odors that result from cooking and ensures a comfortable and healthy cooking environment.</p>\n<p><strong>SmartThings Cooking</strong><br>Enjoy a smarter way to cook with the SmartThings App*. SmartThings Cooking provides recipe recommendations and a guided cooking experience to make meal time easy.</p>\n<p><strong>SmartThings Energy</strong><br>SmartThings lets you monitor and manage your power usage. Get energy saving tips and alerts to help lower your electric bill.*</p>\n<p><strong>Voice Control</strong><br>Control your microwave using voice control.* With Samsung Bixby,** Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant, you can turn your microwave’s ventilation and lighting on and off with a simple command.</p>\n<p><strong>Fingerprint Resistant</strong><br>Fingerprint resistant* for an everyday, beautiful finish.</p>\n<p>Bespoke White Glass finish is not fingerprint resistant.</p>\n<p><strong>Ceramic Enamel Interior</strong><br>The beautiful ceramic blue enamel interior is scratch resistant and easy to clean. This durable ceramic enamel interior provides a polished surface that’s easy to maintain. Effortlessly remove grease or oil from surfaces and protect against scratches that occur from daily use.</p>\n<p><strong>Eco Mode</strong><br>The Eco Mode button conserves power by turning off the display when not in use, so there's no need to unplug with this energy saving microwave.</p>\n<p><strong>Home Dessert</strong><br>The home dessert preset menu includes a wide selection of cooking options, so you can have easy sweets right at your fingertips.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>Dimensions</h2>\n<p><br><strong>Cavity Dimensions (WxHxD)</strong><br>Dimensions: 22 1/8\" x 10 13/16\" x 14 7/8\"</p>\n<p><br><strong>Product Dimensions (WxHxD)</strong><br>Dimensions: 29 7/8\" x 17 1/16\" x 16 1/2\"<br><strong>Weight</strong>: 60.6 lbs</p>\n<p><br><strong>Shipping Dimensions &amp; Weight (WxHxD)</strong><br>Dimensions: 33 11/32\" x 20 13/16\" x 19 3/8\"<br><strong>Weight</strong>: 67.2 lbs</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/9449/1190/files/samsung.png?v=1725837006\"></p>\n</div>",
